{"id":57903,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-02T23:07:48","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T22:07:48","slug":"maratona-de-san-sebastian","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-san-sebastian\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 47\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Zurich Marat\u00f3n Donostia \u2013 San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na encantadora cidade costeira de <strong>San Sebasti\u00e1n (Donostia)<\/strong>, no Pa\u00eds Basco, <strong>Espanha<\/strong>. Sendo a segunda maratona mais antiga de Espanha e uma das provas mais prestigiadas e c\u00e9nicas da Europa, o evento atrai milhares de atletas de dezenas de nacionalidades.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 reconhecido internacionalmente por ser 100% urbano, plano e desenhado ao n\u00edvel do mar ao longo da magn\u00edfica Ba\u00eda de La Concha e das praias de Ondarreta e Zurriola, proporcionando condi\u00e7\u00f5es perfeitas para recordes pessoais. O programa integra a <strong>Maratona (42.195 km)<\/strong> e a prova de <strong>10 km (10K)<\/strong> com chegada apote\u00f3tica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">22 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">San Sebasti\u00e1n (Donostia), Pa\u00eds Basco, Espanha, Internacional<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42.195 km e 10 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Zurich Marat\u00f3n San Sebasti\u00e1n<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Zurich Marat\u00f3n Donostia<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Zurich 10K San Sebasti\u00e1n<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:40<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 47\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partidas pela manh\u00e3 em San Sebasti\u00e1n (Donostia).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a altimetria e perfil do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O circuito \u00e9 completamente plano, sem desn\u00edveis significativos, 100% asfaltado e ao n\u00edvel do mar pela Ba\u00eda de La Concha, sendo ideal para alcan\u00e7ar recordes pessoais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa conta com a Maratona cl\u00e1ssica de 42.195 km e a prova de 10 km (Zurich 10K).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre o levantamento dos dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega de dorsais e a Expo da prova decorrem na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado no Centro Kursaal Elkargunea. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da corrida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem no portal oficial do evento (www.zurichmaratonsansebastian.com).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"San Sebasti\u00e1n (Donostia), Pa\u00eds Basco, Espanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"San Sebasti\u00e1n\", \"addressRegion\": \"Internacional\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Zurich Marat\u00f3n San Sebasti\u00e1n\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Maratona de San Sebasti\u00e1n 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 47\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partidas pela manh\u00e3 em San Sebasti\u00e1n (Donostia).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a altimetria e perfil do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O circuito \u00e9 completamente plano, sem desn\u00edveis significativos, 100% asfaltado e ao n\u00edvel do mar pela Ba\u00eda de La Concha, sendo ideal para alcan\u00e7ar recordes pessoais.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa conta com a Maratona cl\u00e1ssica de 42.195 km e a prova de 10 km (Zurich 10K).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde decorre o levantamento dos dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega de dorsais e a Expo da prova decorrem na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado no Centro Kursaal Elkargunea. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da corrida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem no portal oficial do evento (www.zurichmaratonsansebastian.com).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":57905,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57903","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-malaga-espanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.co